<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id0c3b9e25-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd" identifier="/us/usc/t16/s470aaa–2"><num value="470aaa–2">§ 470aaa–2.</num><heading> Public awareness and education program</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The Secretary shall establish a program to increase public awareness about the significance of paleontological resources.</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id0c3b9e26-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd">(<ref href="/us/pl/111/11/tVI/s6303">Pub. L. 111–11, title VI, § 6303</ref>, <date date="2009-03-30">Mar. 30, 2009</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/123/1173">123 Stat. 1173</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
